<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Roblox Anti-AFK</Major>
    <Description>Great to use when games have an anti-auto clicker

Simply run the macro and youre good to go

NOTE: may not work for all games depending on certain factors such as clicking a certain part of the screen</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 26 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 4 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 4 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 22 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 7 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 7 1
Delay 64
GoWhile 1 86400000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>